# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:由開始嗰陣再做過；指之前嘅嘢失敗咗或者唔滿意，就推倒重嚟，重新開始做
eng:to start over from the beginning; to start from scratch
<eg>
yue:今次考試唔合格，唯有下學期從頭再嚟。 (gam1 ci3 haau2 si3 m4 hap6 gaak3, wei4 jau5 haa6 hok6 kei4 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4.)
eng:I failed this exam, so I have no choice but to start over next semester.
<eg>
yue:個計劃做得唔啱，不如從頭再嚟過啦。 (go3 gai3 waak6 zou6 dak1 m4 ngaam1, bat1 jyu4 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4 gwo3 laa1.)
eng:The plan didn't turn out right; we might as well start over from scratch. [end of text]


